    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsociable detective of the Police Department leads a quiet, uneventful life in a sleepy southern town. But everything changes when his superior assigns him to the case of two missing young people \u2014 a search that soon spirals into an inexplicable nightmare full of strange fads. Because the person who reported the disappearance... doesn\u2019t exist in any conventional sense of the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aenigmarch\u00a0is a visual kinetic novel in the genre of a mystical thriller with elements of surrealism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique, hand-crafted art</strong> \u2013 Every scene is drawn from scratch: no templates, no repeats \u2014 just rich, immersive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between noir and color modes</strong> \u2013 Experience the story in classic black-and-white or full color, depending on your mood.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unsociable detective of the Police Department leads a quiet, uneventful life in a sleepy southern town. But everything changes when his superior assigns him to the case of two missing young people \u2014 a search that soon spirals into an inexplicable nightmare full of strange fads. Because the person who reported the disappearance... doesn\u2019t exist in any conventional sense of the word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aenigmarch\u00a0is a visual kinetic novel in the genre of a mystical thriller with elements of surrealism.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique, hand-crafted art</strong> \u2013 Every scene is drawn from scratch: no templates, no repeats \u2014 just rich, immersive environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch between noir and color modes</strong> \u2013 Experience the story in classic black-and-white or full color, depending on your mood.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Step into a chilling mystery and peel back the ominous veil shrouding a peaceful southern Russian town.",
